                {
                    "row": 1,
                    "col": 0,
                    "text": "2.1 Remarks on the accompanying documentation (none, or give comments):1. Provided document on quality year of issue 2018: No. 529140336 dated 2018-11-26, No. 529140398 dated 2018-12-19. According to subsection 1.2, the Goods supplied shall be new, manufactured not earlier than 2023/Предоставлен документ о качестве годом выдачи 2018: No 529140336 от 2018-11-26, No 529140398 от 2018-12-19. Согласно подразделу 1.2 поставляемый Товар должен быть новым, выпуска не ранее 2023 года; 2. Item No. 000581/24 Anchors with undercut HDA-P M12x125/30 3315478 according to the quality document No. 000581/24, in fact item No. 331546/Артикул по документу о качестве No 000581/24 Анкера с подрезкой HDA-P M12x125/30 3315478, по факту артикул 331546.",
                    "gridspan": 5,
                    "vmerge": null,
                    "is_header": false,
                    "anchor": null
                },
                {
                    "row": 2,
                    "col": 0,
                    "text": "2.2. Remarks for visual, measurement and other inspections including Materials completeness (none, or give comments):1. According to the markings on the box, the year of manufacture of the anchor is 05.2020, 10.2016, 05.2018. Requirements of subclause 1.2: the supplied Goods shall be new, manufactured not earlier than 2023/Согласно маркировкам на коробке год выпуска анкера 05.2020, 10.2016, 05.2018. Требования подраздела 1.2: поставляемый Товар должен быть новым, выпуска не ранее 2023 года.",
                    "gridspan": 5,
                    "vmerge": null,
                    "is_header": false,
                    "anchor": null
                },
                {
                    "row": 3,
                    "col": 0,
                    "text": "2.3. Remarks for preservation and/or anticorrosive coating (none, or give comments): NONE",
